   36                                   ;
   37                                   ; This is a cleaned-up and commented version of the main source code
   38                                   ; file 'yak.s' for Tempest 2000. No code has been changed, so this source file
   39                                   ; can be used to create a build of Tempest 2000 that is byte-for-byte
   40                                   ; identical to the original 1994 release.
   41                                   ;
