 9931                                       
 9932                                           ; Draw a solid polygon bullet instead of a vector based one. The bullet is taken
 9933                                           ; from the sprite sheet in 'beasty3.cry' (pic). This is an exception to the rule
 9934                                           ; for nearly all other objects, which are usually constructed polygons.
 9935                                   oaafire:
 9936  000080AA  203C00B6000A                   move.l #$b6000a,d0         ; x/y for the default bullet in sprite sheet 'pic'.
 9937  000080B0  223C00070007                   move.l #$070007,d1         ; width/height for the default bullet in sprite sheet 'pic'.
 9938  000080B6  4A680020                       tst 32(a0)                 ; What type of bullet are we using?
 9939  000080BA  6700xxxx                       beq konk                   ; If default, skip to konk.
