11901  0000990E  B07C00BE                       cmp #webz+80,d0


                                        src/yak.s            Page 229     5:01:00 pm 29-Sep-2026        RMAC 2.1.01 (Linux/OSX)


11902  00009912  6C00xxxx                       bge rspik1
