13057                                   toweb:
13058  0000A72E  6100xxxx                       bsr webinfo                ; Get the X and Y position for this lane.
13059  0000A732  4844                           swap d4                    ; Swap position of the first 2 bytes with last 2 bytes.
13060  0000A734  4244                           clr d4
