20346                                   ; *******************************************************************
20347                                   ; Vertex list defining the player's claws for 'classic' tempest.
20348                                   ; Each vertex group has the components:
20349                                   ;   - x,y,z


                                        src/yak.s            Page 385     5:01:00 pm 29-Sep-2026        RMAC 2.1.01 (Linux/OSX)


20350                                   ;   - a list of connected vertices terminated with a 0
20351                                   ; Each array terminates with a 0.
20352                                   ;
20353                                   ; So for example, 'claw1' breaks down as follows:
20354                                   ; 6,4,1   = x,y,z
20355                                   ; 2       = Connected to vertex  with index 2 (i.e. 3,9,1).
20356                                   ; 8       = Connected to vertex  with index 8 (i.e. 1,9,1).
20357                                   ; 0       = End of vertex group
20358                                   ;
20359                                   ; 3,9,1,  = x,y,z
20360                                   ; 3       = Connected to vertex  with index 3 (i.e. 9,12,1).
20361                                   ; 0       = End of vertex group
20362                                   ;
20363                                   ; 9,12,1  = x,y,z
20364                                   ; 4       = Connected to vertex with index 4 (i.e. 15,9,1).
20365                                   ; 0       = End of vertex group
20366                                   ;
20367                                   ; and so on.
20368                                   ; *******************************************************************
