21990                                   
21991                                   ; *******************************************************************
21992                                   ; Vertex lists defining different enemy objects. These are used for the
21993                                   ; Tempest 'classic' mode. The Tempest 2000 versions are in obj2d.s.
21994                                   ;
21995                                   ; Each vertex group has the components:
21996                                   ;   - x,y,z
21997                                   ;   - a list of connected vertices terminated with a 0
21998                                   ;     or
21999                                   ;     -1 followed by the value of the color to use when drawing
22000                                   ; Each array terminates with a 0.
22001                                   ;
22002                                   ; So for example, 'shot' breaks down as follows:
22003                                   ; 8,7,1   = x,y,z
22004                                   ; 2       = Connected to vertex  with index 2 (i.e. 10,11,1).
22005                                   ; 0       = End of vertex group
22006                                   ;


                                        src/yak.s            Page 421     5:01:00 pm 29-Sep-2026        RMAC 2.1.01 (Linux/OSX)


22007                                   ; 10,11,1 = x,y,z
22008                                   ; 0       = End of vertex group
22009                                   ;
22010                                   ; 10,7,1  = x,y,z
22011                                   ; 4       = Connected to vertex with index 4 (i.e. 8,11,1)
22012                                   ; 0       = End of vertex group
22013                                   ;
22014                                   ; and so on.
22015                                   ; An example with a color command is:
22016                                   ;   dc.b 7,8,1,-1,255,9,19,0
22017                                   ; This breaks down as:
22018                                   ; 7,8,1   = x,y,z
22019                                   ; -1      = Need to change color
22020                                   ; 255     = New color value to use when drawing lines
22021                                   ; 9       = Connected to vertex with index 9.
22022                                   ; 19      = Connected to vertex with index 19.
22023                                   ; 0       = End of vertex group
22024                                   ; *******************************************************************
