23673                                   ; main one and it is this one that the GPU and Blitter draws most
23674                                   ; stuff to.
23675                                   ; Each entry is four words (16 bytes) long and is of the form:
23676                                   ; - Width
23677                                   ; - Height
23678                                   ; - Depth
