23874                                   ; *******************************************************************
23875                                   ; This contains the object code from syn6.o, which is the Imagitec
23876                                   ; 'mod' player for the Jaguar, adapted for Tempest 2K.
23877                                   ; 'Mod' is a sound file format. All of the T2K tunes use the format.
23878                                   ; The Sound FX do not used the 'mod' format, they are just PCM data.
23879                                   ; The Imagitec Mod player is basically a 4 channel protrack mod player and 4 channels for sfx.
23880                                   ; https://forums.atariage.com/topic/157184-imagitec-designs-mod-player-informations/
23881                                   ; *******************************************************************
23882                                   .include "dat/moomoo.dat"
