24039                                   ; These are flags passed to the GPU. They are either on or off.
24040                                   ; Note that only the first byte is actually used as the flags are set
24041                                   ; at bit level and we only have six flags (so six bits in the first byte
24042                                   ; are used):
24043                                   ; Bit 0 - Hardware Interlace On/Off
24044                                   ; Bit 1 - Fat/Skinny Vectors
24045                                   ; Bit 2 - Beastly Mode On/Off
24046                                   ; Bit 3 - Rotary controller On/Off - Player 1
24047                                   ; Bit 4 - Rotary controller On/Off - Player 2
24048                                   ; Bit 5 - PAL On/Off
24049                                   ; Bit 6 - Controllers On/Off
24050                                   ;  
