24184                                   ; *******************************************************************
24185                                   ; This data structure is used to construct the Object List (aka the
24186                                   ; Display List) in 'blist' by RunBeasties. It is the items in blist
24187                                   ; that actually get drawn to the screen. THere are 12 items in total.
24188                                   ;
24189                                   ; Data structure of items in 'beasties':
24190                                   ; 0-3      X
24191                                   ; 4-7      Y 
24192                                   ; 12-13    Object Mode
24193                                   ; 14-15    Object Type
24194                                   ; 16-18    Pointer to screen data.
24195                                   ; 20-22    Index to post-creation routine in 'postfixups'.
24196                                   ; *******************************************************************
